      "Manager P 2(0 (CO YV14). a) to CharaCe Set Fandlar 3.\nRoig; Mr. Nevaldo Rocha, President of Lloyd Aéreo Boliviano; and Mr\nJ. A. Wilbur of Grace y Cia. (Bolivia).",
      "CANAGRA\nRANAGRA",
      "{Arz\nARRIVAL AT LA PAZ' \"EL ALTO\" AIRPORI of Mr. Harold J. Roig and\nMr. Gerhard Gessell on July 2,1943.",
      "Mr. Harold J. Roig's press conference which took place\nat his suite in the Carrera Hotel was attended by reporters from\nall papers and news services. From left to right: Mr. Mario Quiros\nPanagra Chief Publicity; Mr. Roig; and Mr. Cristian Trampe from th\nAssociated Press.",
